# Include your custom_postgui HAL commands here
# This file will not be overwritten when you run PNCconf again

# The drawbar lift valve (7i84 output 5) is driven by motion.digital-out-00 (M64/M65 P0) in
# Mesa7I96S.hal, so G-code can run the drawbar. (It used to be the screen's milo.drawbar-lift.)

# The camera's line laser: the screen's milo.laser, or'd with M64 P1 (see Mesa7I96S.hal)
net laser-screen milo.laser => laser-or.in1
